================================================================================
SECTION A — SOURCE-CANONICAL STATE CHAIN  (power-on -> first gameplay)
================================================================================
Master-mode note: *master-mode* DEFAULTS to 'game (gkernel.gc:270). There is NO
`set-master-mode 'title` anywhere — the entire SCE screen + ND logo + title-logo
flythrough + press-start attract all run under master-mode 'game. The only
explicit transitions are into 'progress (title menu) and back to 'game (New Game).

 1. KERNEL BOOT -> (play #t #t)
      goal_src/jak1/engine/level/level.gc:978-1020   (play ...)
      *kernel-boot-message* = 'play  => startup-level = 'title  (level.gc:985-987)
      log: "(play :use-vis ~A :init-game ~A) has been called!" (level.gc:981)
      log: "Load complete. Level: ~A. Now starting display!"   (level.gc:1015)

 2. (initialize! *game-info* 'game #f #f) -> continue-point "title-start"
      goal_src/jak1/engine/game/game-info.gc:141-258 (continue select 176-181)
      "title-start": goal_src/jak1/engine/level/level-info.gc:2320-2339
        :level 'title  :flags (continue-flags title)  :lev0 'title :lev1 'village1

 3. target reads (continue-flags title) -> (go target-title)        [enter-state]
      goal_src/jak1/engine/target/target-death.gc:147-149

 4. STATE target-title   (master-mode 'game)
      goal_src/jak1/levels/title/title-obs.gc:523-603
      - shows the SCE/SCEA boot static screen (territory SCEI / *first-boot*):
          static-screen-spawn, title-obs.gc:553-563   (texture, not a text string)
      - spawns the logo processes (title-obs.gc:596-601):
          (process-spawn logo "logo-1" ... 'ndi)   <- Naughty Dog logo
          (process-spawn logo          ... 'logo)   <- Jak & Daxter title logo
      - (go target-title-play)                                       [enter-state]

 5. STATE logo  (process; type def title-obs.gc:10-25, init 417-521)
      arg 'ndi  -> (go-virtual ndi)      title-obs.gc:334-415  plays "ndi-intro"
      arg 'logo -> (go-virtual startup)  title-obs.gc:151-283  plays "logo-intro",
                   then "logo-intro-2", then loops "logo-loop" (idle 285-315)
      slave actors: logo-slave x N (*logo-cam-sg* *logo-volumes-sg* *logo-black-sg*
                    *ndi-cam-sg* *ndi-volumes-sg*), *jchar-sg* (Jak), *sidekick-sg*
                    (Daxter), an othercam camera. (title-obs.gc:176-192, 381-391)

 6. STATE target-title-play <-> target-title-wait   (title attract / PRESS START)
      target-title-play: title-obs.gc:605-621  (:code anim-loop)
      target-title-wait: title-obs.gc:623-666  draws press-start text (line 664):
        (print-game-text (lookup-text! *common-text* (text-id press-start) #f) ...)
      on (cpad-pressed? 0 start): (activate-progress *dproc* (progress-screen title))
        title-obs.gc:656  -> opens the title menu, master-mode becomes 'progress

 7. TITLE MENU -> NEW GAME -> set-master-mode 'game -> continue "intro-start"
      progress process: goal_src/jak1/engine/ui/progress/progress.gc (+ pc override
        goal_src/jak1/pc/progress-pc.gc:2835-2870)
      New Game: (initialize! *game-info* 'game #f "intro-start"); (set-master-mode 'game)
        progress-pc.gc:2841 / progress.gc:832-833
      "intro-start": goal_src/jak1/engine/level/level-info.gc:230-236
        :level 'village1  :flags (continue-flags intro)

 8. target reads (continue-flags intro) -> (start-sequence-a)        [enter-state]
      goal_src/jak1/engine/target/target-death.gc:149
      start-sequence-a: goal_src/jak1/levels/village1/sequence-a-village1.gc:328-332
        (process-spawn sequenceA-village1 (entity-by-name "sage-23") :to *entity-pool*)
      STATE play-anim (the playable village1 / Geyser-Rock intro cinematic):
        goal_src/jak1/levels/village1/sequence-a-village1.gc:234  (task (game-task intro))

MASTER-MODE VALUE ORDER:  'game (boot, covers SCE+logo+title attract)
                       -> 'progress (title menu opened via activate-progress)
                       -> 'game (New Game; carries into village1 + intro cinematic)

