INTERPRETATION FOR THE FIX PHASES
  The pristine title sequence is: SCE static screen -> ND "ndi-intro" -> Jak&Daxter
  "logo-intro"/"logo-intro-2" flythrough -> "logo-loop" attract, all under
  master-mode 'game, holding at target-title-play/-wait until START is pressed.
  Android is "correct" when, diffing its boot log against this with
  compare-3tier.sh --boot, the markers logo / ndi-intro / logo-intro / logo-loop
  appear in this order and NOTHING title-only over-spawns before them. Pressing
  START then drives progress (menu) -> New Game -> sequence-a-village1 cinematic.
